From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gellert <gellert.hegyi@around.co>
Date: Thu, 12 Aug 2021 15:39:31 +0200
Subject: adds shader based transforms to video element

This patch adds support for the data-circle-crop, data-filter-id and data-bounding-box attribute on a video tag that allows to crop the video to a circle, apply different filters and animate a bounding box using shaders for the video element.

